SegmentLens is an unofficial independent implementation of a small columnar
query subsystem inspired by DuckDB. DuckDB architecture and algorithms remain
attributed to their upstream authors. No DuckDB source code is redistributed.
See THIRD_PARTY.md for provenance and dependency licensing.

SegmentLens为非官方独立子系统实现；上游架构和成熟算法归属原作者。
